msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum-safe "
"cryptography skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Passe un examen de 20 questions sur le site IBM Training pour tester tes "
"compétences en cryptographie post-quantique et reçois un badge via Credly."

